('about_story', 'About Story', true, $$
{"eyebrow":"About Shalom Logistics","heading":"A Nairobi start. A countrywide commitment.","body":"Shalom Logistics began as a small, in-county moving service in Nairobi. As our customers' needs and trust grew, we expanded our reach countrywide while holding on to the personal care that shaped our beginnings.","closing":"Wherever you are headed, our promise is simple: we settle you in.","image":"/images/IMG_20251220_105405.jpg","imageAlt":"Shalom Logistics crew preparing a residential move","ctaLabel":"Explore our services","ctaHref":"/services","mapHeading":"From Nairobi to across Kenya.","mapBody":"We began as a small Nairobi moving service and grew to serve customers countrywide, carrying the same thoughtful planning and careful handling into every journey. Wherever you are headed, our promise is simple: we settle you in.","mapLocations":[{"name":"Nairobi","longitude":36.82,"latitude":-1.29},{"name":"Mombasa","longitude":39.67,"latitude":-4.04},{"name":"Kisumu","longitude":34.77,"latitude":-0.09}]}
