{"heading":"Purpose in every move.","intro":"The principles behind how we care, plan, and show up for every move.","slides":[{"title":"Mission","heading":"Make moving simpler. Make transitions reassuring.","body":"We bring thoughtful planning, careful handling, and dependable support to moving and related services.","image":"/images/IMG_20251114_133226.jpg","imageAlt":"Shalom Logistics moving service photograph for the mission slide","placeholder":"Placeholder — replace with Shalom crew photo","isVisible":true},{"title":"Vision","heading":"Be a trusted partner wherever the next move leads.","body":"We aim to serve people and businesses throughout Kenya with care that feels personal at every step.","image":"/images/IMG_20251204_115746.jpg","imageAlt":"Shalom Logistics moving and logistics photograph for the vision slide","placeholder":"Placeholder — replace with Shalom truck photo","isVisible":true}],"valuesHeading":"What we stand for.","values":[{"title":"Care","description":"We treat each home, workplace, and belonging with thoughtful attention.","isVisible":true},{"title":"Reliability","description":"We plan carefully and work to make every step dependable and clear.","isVisible":true},{"title":"Integrity","description":"We communicate honestly and approach every responsibility with respect.","isVisible":true},{"title":"Customer focus","description":"We listen first, then shape the service around your needs and priorities.","isVisible":true}],"goalsHeading":"Better moves, made thoughtfully.","goals":[{"title":"Simpler planning","description":"Make moving and related services easier to plan.","isVisible":true},{"title":"Careful handling","description":"Protect belongings with careful preparation and handling.","isVisible":true},{"title":"Countrywide service","description":"Keep extending dependable service across Kenya.","isVisible":true}]}
