{"statsHeading":"What do people have to say about us?","statsIntro":"Real experiences from customers we've helped settle in across Kenya.","stats":[{"value":"500+","label":"Happy Clients","detail":"Successfully relocated homes and offices across the country.","isVisible":true},{"value":"4.9","label":"Average Rating","detail":"Consistently rated 5-stars for our care and reliability.","isVisible":true},{"value":"24/7","label":"Support","detail":"Our dedicated team is always ready to assist you.","isVisible":true}],"testimonialsHeading":"Words from our customers","testimonialsIntro":"Experiences shared by people we've helped move.","testimonials":[{"quote":"From packing to transport, they were exceptional. Affordable rates and excellent service. Will definitely use them again.","attribution":"Aisha W. · Kisumu","isVisible":true},{"quote":"Relocating our entire corporate office seemed impossible, but Shalom Logistics handled it flawlessly over a single weekend. Highly recommended.","attribution":"Brian K. · Nairobi CBD","isVisible":true},{"quote":"I was worried about my fragile items making the long trip from Nairobi to the coast. Everything arrived in pristine condition.","attribution":"Sarah M. · Mombasa","isVisible":true},{"quote":"The team showed up right on time, packed everything securely, and unpacked it just as fast. True professionals.","attribution":"David O. · Westlands","isVisible":true},{"quote":"I loved the 'We settle you in' promise—they actually helped arrange the heavy furniture in my new living room before leaving!","attribution":"Grace N. · Karen","isVisible":true},{"quote":"Absolutely zero stress. The crew was polite, energetic, and treated my belongings with the utmost care.","attribution":"Emmanuel T. · Kilimani","isVisible":true}]}
